abstract: >-
  Educational techno-economic optimization of a solar-powered sustainable
  aviation fuel facility in Arizona. Developed as a Fall 2025 Introduction
  to Sustainable Energy Systems course project, with a September 2026
  analysis update using 2024 hourly weather. Includes model equations,
  dated assumptions, sensitivity results and reproducibility instructions.
keywords:
  - sustainable aviation fuel
  - solar energy
  - techno-economic analysis
  - linear optimization
